# Build artifacts (see CLAUDE.md: "build artifacts (*.o/*.mod/*.x) ... routinely
# show up as untracked/modified in git status and are not meaningful diffs on
# their own" -- tracking them was a pre-existing mistake this formalizes fixing).
*.o
*.mod
*.x

# Run outputs and scratch, TOP LEVEL ONLY.  The leading slash matters: the
# 3bodydata_*/ dataset directories are tracked data and their own .dat files must
# NOT be ignored -- committing datasets is the convention in this repo.
/*.dat
/*.log
/*.scratch
/fort.*
/*.inp.bak
/*.bak

# macOS
.DS_Store
